✅ Reproducibility status
At this stage:

the article and final DOI are available;
the figures have been recovered and stored in images/;
the bibliography has been archived in Zenodo;
the website structure is reproducible with Quarto;
the original complete analysis code is not assumed to be preserved.

Future reconstructed scripts should therefore be versioned transparently and documented as reimplementations based on the published methodology.
